  "details": "Looking at old cannys, it seems this was a previous issue that was solved in 2020. Well, its back. \n\nThey have blocked me. When I join an instance they are in, I can see them. I cannot hear them. They cannot see or hear me. Sometimes, their avatar will not load and I will see them as the Error Bot, sometimes the avatar even loads. I can select their bubble and view their profile. One thing that is missing on the profile is the mutual connections (we have mutual friends and groups, this is why I end up joining instances they are in). \n\nMe and the player who blocked me play on PCVR, but this bug could be cross platform. I will put my current build down in the build section, but this issue has persisted through multiple updates.",
